<title>UK: UK's Scholl set for acquisition - paper.</title>
<headline>UK's Scholl set for acquisition - paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British footware and footcare company Scholl Plc looks set to acquire the Scholl operations in Latin America, the Times newspaper said on Monday.</p>
<p>The company also wants to acquire the rights to the Scholl business in North America as part of a plan to take control of the brand name outside Europe, the paper said.</p>
<p>The report said the acquisition of the Latin American business, with turnover of around $10 million, is expected to be completed by the end of February.</p>
</text>
